+# TAC-1 visual polish — DONE
+
+- Confirmed the chapter links the light-theme stack: `../design/tokens.css`, `../design/base.css`, and the shared large-frame rules in `../design/components.css`.
+- Expanded teaching figures to the available chapter width, capped at 1100px, with readable captions and no thumbnail-sized two-column frame cards.
+- Changed paired source frames to a single-column, full-width sequence.
+- Added the generated agentic-systems plate to the hero/orientation.
+- Added the generated Stop Coding plate at the opening of the Stop Coding tactic.
+- Added the generated Core Four infographic at the opening of the Core Four section.
+- Kept the existing lesson prose, examples, diagrams, source frames, labs, and teaching sequence intact.
+- Added intrinsic image dimensions and retained responsive sizing for stable desktop and mobile rendering.
+- Verified all chapter stylesheet, navigation, source-frame, and generated-image paths resolve from `vol-1-tac/`.
