+- Added the generated Core Four infographic at the opening of the Core Four section.
+- Kept the existing lesson prose, examples, diagrams, source frames, labs, and teaching sequence intact.
+- Added intrinsic image dimensions and retained responsive sizing for stable desktop and mobile rendering.
+- Verified all chapter stylesheet, navigation, source-frame, and generated-image paths resolve from `vol-1-tac/`.
