    50	        <h1>Hello Agentic Coding</h1>
    51	        <p class="hero__dek">The decisive move is not a better code-generation prompt. It is turning a prompt into a reliable engineering workflow—and turning the agent into a component you can call.</p>
    52	        <ul class="hero__meta" aria-label="Chapter details">
    53	          <li>Video spine · 21:51</li>
    54	          <li>Lab · 45–75 min</li>
